# them all of docs/decisions/, whose own README states that a claim id
# cited there "is judged against the ledger like any other living
# document". Dropping it would have made that sentence false.
#
# Widening this scope widens the RETRACTION GATE too: an id cited in a
# decision record or a governance note now blocks its tombstone until the
# citation is released. That is the intended direction -- those documents
# are live prose, not frozen reference.
docs/decisions/*.md
docs/governance/*.md
docs/specs/*.md
docs/agent-onboarding.md
docs/refactor/00-RUNBOOK.md
